  "body": "SchemaCrawler  release at last commit e9a5f33011b00380e691a88308430d4f09530a96\nSee the change history at https://www.schemacrawler.com/changes-report.html\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* Bump chainguard-dev/actions/setup-gitsign from 1.7.1 to 1.7.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2542\n* Be consistent in how external configuration is specified and read by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2543\n* Add deny list for model deserialization by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2544\n* Bump org.firebirdsql:firebird-testcontainers-java from 2.0.0 to 2.0.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2549\n* Bump com.ing.data:cassandra-jdbc-wrapper from 5.0.4 to 5.0.5 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2548\n* Bump org.graalvm.polyglot:js from 25.4.4.1.1 to 25.5.5.0.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2546\n* Bump org.graalvm.polyglot:polyglot from 25.4.4.1.1 to 25.5.5.0.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2545\n* Do not expose database URL in logs by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2550\n* Prepare for the next release by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2551\n* Show URL in connection test output by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2552\n* Organize configuration settings by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2555\n* Bump github/codeql-action from 4.39.1 to 4.39.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2554\n* Bump chainguard-dev/actions/setup-gitsign from 1.7.2 to 1.8.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2553\n* Reset PostgreSQL search_path by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2556\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/compare/v18.0.1...v18.0.2",
